WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.379 --> 00:00:02.212
- Come on over!

00:00:02.212 --> 00:00:03.045
Look at those boots!

00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:04.024
- Right?

00:00:04.024 --> 00:00:04.879
- Yes!

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:06.900
Oh my gosh, and the dress and the hair!

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.190
I love everything that's happening.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.047
This is like we only allow
super models on our show

00:00:11.047 --> 00:00:11.880
(laughing)

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.550
- [Kelly] So that's why they're all here.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.330
Okay so, we were talking about
our presidential slogans.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.750
It's going online, what would
your presidential slogans be?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.190
From like your last text.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.950
So, your name, the year you
pick, and the last text.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.243
- So it would be,

00:00:26.897 --> 00:00:29.263
"Alano Miller, 2024:

00:00:30.227 --> 00:00:31.217
"No problem."

00:00:32.162 --> 00:00:34.579
(applauding)

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:37.138
- [Kelly] That's actually awesome!

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:37.971
- I mean...

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:41.123
- I would love for it to
be "no problems," damn!

00:00:41.123 --> 00:00:42.569
- [Xosha] I kind of like yours!

00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:44.370
- Okay, what's yours?

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.283
- Xosha Roquemore, 20-twenty-never:

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.000
"I'm finna walk on stage
in a couple minutes."

00:00:53.408 --> 00:00:54.400
- [Kelly] So you be ready!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.930
I love this game, I will
play with everyone I know.

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:00.830
So both of you, Cherish The
Day is on Oprah's network,

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.440
and have y'all met Oprah before?

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.320
- You know, I met her a long time ago,

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.720
the first movie I did was Precious,

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:06.870
and she was a producer on that,

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.150
so I like met her in that mix.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:12.870
But for Cherish, we
haven't officially met her.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.037
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- But she was

00:01:14.037 --> 00:01:14.870
- [Kelly] Wait, what does that mean?

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:15.703
What's "officially?"

00:01:15.703 --> 00:01:16.536
- [Alano] (holding in laughter) because...

00:01:16.536 --> 00:01:17.713
- She was at the table read.
- I want to hear you!

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:21.020
I'm so excited!

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.860
- Because we walked in,
and we were both nervous,

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.220
'cause you know, it's everybody,

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.721
it's a table read and
this is the point where

00:01:26.721 --> 00:01:28.930
you can either keep the
job, or they fire you.

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:31.530
But, so, we were like,
"we gotta do our thing."

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:36.140
and we walk in and we see
her on this big television.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:36.973
- Oh she's somewhere else!

00:01:36.973 --> 00:01:37.806
She's Skyping in?

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.860
Okay.
- Yes, she's Skyping in.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.730
- Well, she's Oprah, she's got a lot.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:41.563
- Right!

00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:43.780
And she looks, you know,
she's got her glasses on.

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:45.520
She's ready, she's got her notes,

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.860
she's starting to write things down.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.360
And we're like, "Is this
just a video?" And then...

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:50.760
- Right, well we knew it was real,

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:52.470
'cause when we first walked
on, she wasn't on the screen,

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:55.340
but there was like a butler
setting up like a meal

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:56.783
- Putting it over.
- And orange juice.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.987
Then she just slid in,
in her glasses like,

00:01:58.987 --> 00:02:00.302
"Hello!"

00:02:00.302 --> 00:02:02.732
- "Harriet's Cheesecake.

00:02:02.732 --> 00:02:04.580
"Hello cheesecake!"

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:05.681
and I was like, "What?"

00:02:05.681 --> 00:02:06.514
- [Kelly] Oh my God!

00:02:06.514 --> 00:02:08.180
You got to talk about
cheesecake with Oprah?

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.125
- [Xosha] Yes!
- [Alano] Yeah!

00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:10.710
- Yes!

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.754
That is my kind of woman!

00:02:12.754 --> 00:02:13.662
- Yes!

00:02:13.662 --> 00:02:15.103
- Yes!

00:02:15.103 --> 00:02:17.670
I don't want anybody up in
here talkin' about kale salad.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.803
I want to talk about cheesecake!

00:02:19.803 --> 00:02:20.973
- Harriet's Cheesecake.

00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:22.500
- I knew I loved her.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.570
Okay so, Rosario, do
you have an Oprah story?

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:28.460
- Well the first time I met
her was just doing her show

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:29.990
because of doing press for Seven Pounds,

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:31.750
but my good story, I think,

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:35.250
is being at Critic's
Choice Awards with my mom,

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.647
sitting next to Common, who was like,

00:02:36.647 --> 00:02:37.480
"Your mom's lookin' good!"

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.640
I was like, "Yes, she is!"

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.187
and she was like, "Excuse me, Common,

00:02:40.187 --> 00:02:41.500
"Oprah's over there."

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.470
So we like went over to Oprah's table,

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:45.970
and then she got Ava
DuVernay to take our photo.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:46.803
I was like, "That's Ava DuVernay."

00:02:46.803 --> 00:02:47.960
She was like, "It's Oprah!"

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.400
I was like, "Okay."

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.820
So then, we took a photo,

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.542
and my mom, because I'm
working on Ava's new show,

00:02:53.542 --> 00:02:56.297
my mom goes, "Ask Ava

00:02:56.297 --> 00:02:58.547
"to ask Oprah for the photo

00:02:58.547 --> 00:03:01.072
"that we took all those years ago."

00:03:01.072 --> 00:03:01.905
I was like, "Mom, why would she have it?"

00:03:01.905 --> 00:03:02.738
She goes, "No, don't you remember?

00:03:02.738 --> 00:03:04.260
"Oprah took it on her Blackberry."

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:06.117
I'm like, "No she didn't
take it on her Blackberry.

00:03:06.117 --> 00:03:07.010
"Why would she do that?"

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:08.352
She's like, "No, you just need to ask!"

00:03:08.352 --> 00:03:09.887
So I told it to Ava, and Ava's like,

00:03:09.887 --> 00:03:10.860
"I'll find the photo of you!"

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.769
I was like, "No, no, none of this.

00:03:12.769 --> 00:03:13.602
"not this."

00:03:13.602 --> 00:03:14.750
We'll try to take a new one.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.470
We'll all take one together.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:17.721
- [Xosha] Yes!
- [Alano] Yes!

00:03:17.721 --> 00:03:18.641
- And we'll talk about cheesecake.

00:03:18.641 --> 00:03:21.249
- I want to come but only
if there's cheesecake.

00:03:21.249 --> 00:03:22.082
- [Rosario] Vegan cheesecake!

00:03:22.082 --> 00:03:22.915
- Yes.

00:03:22.915 --> 00:03:23.748
- [Alano] We'll make it happen.

00:03:23.748 --> 00:03:24.710
- Thank you!

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.900
Dreams: check!

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.870
Um, so, tell us about your show though,

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:28.969
Cherish The Day.

00:03:28.969 --> 00:03:29.802
- Go ahead.

00:03:29.802 --> 00:03:30.635
- Oo, that was me.

00:03:32.966 --> 00:03:36.100
Cherish The Day is a new anthology series.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.530
- [Xosha] It's on OWN, so each season

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.260
will focus on a different couple.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:43.269
So this inaugural season
focuses on our couple,

00:03:43.269 --> 00:03:46.280
Gently James and Evan Fisher.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.450
And what makes it cool

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.370
and different than your
regular romance show

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.710
is that each episode takes
placed over a 24 hour period.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.521
So you're really able to get in there

00:03:54.521 --> 00:03:56.090
and get to know the characters.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.460
And it's chronological, but it's like,

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.050
the first episode is when we meet.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.920
The next episode is like a year later.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.050
And so on and so forth,

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.972
so we follow them over the
course of about 5 years

00:04:04.972 --> 00:04:07.390
in these 24 hour increments.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.330
- I would- y'all two look gorgeous

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.780
and you sound fun as hell, I'd watch it!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.190
- [Kelly] I love y'all!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.581
(cheering)

00:04:13.581 --> 00:04:14.887
- [Alano] Thank you, thank you!

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:16.421
- So, did you know each other?

00:04:16.421 --> 00:04:18.923
Y'all knew each other
before you worked together?

00:04:18.923 --> 00:04:19.756
- [Alano] Yes.
- [Xosha] Yes!

00:04:19.756 --> 00:04:20.930
- For a while!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.801
I went to college with his wife!

00:04:22.801 --> 00:04:23.634
- Yeah.

00:04:23.634 --> 00:04:24.467
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:04:24.467 --> 00:04:25.300
- Yeah.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.660
- And y'all just randomly
ended up getting chosen

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.540
to be in this together?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.510
That's crazy!

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:30.180
- Yeah, I mean, we read.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:33.490
For sure, we read and
when I read with Alano

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:36.760
there was a lot of like
personality chemistry.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:37.593
- [Kelly] 'cause you knew each other!

00:04:37.593 --> 00:04:38.590
- Yeah.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:39.423
- [Kelly] There was a vibe already.

00:04:39.423 --> 00:04:40.256
- It was fine, it was comfortable, yeah.

00:04:40.256 --> 00:04:41.640
- There was a lot of trust,
a lot of safety there.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:43.840
- [Kelly] That's awesome,
I'm not an actor,

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:44.730
so is that a lot of it?

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:45.680
Like when you go in, you have to

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:46.810
have chemistry with the other person?

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.302
Is that a lot of how you
get the job or you don't?

00:04:48.302 --> 00:04:50.870
- Yeah, they be callin'
them "chemistry reads."

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.502
(laughing)

00:04:52.502 --> 00:04:54.197
- And this is the chemistry
read, that's the test!

00:04:54.197 --> 00:04:58.008
- Man, I've been trying to
have chemistry with everyone!

00:04:58.008 --> 00:04:58.841
(laughing)

